    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Analyze, strategize, and execute impressive golf shots using classic mechanics! 3-Click Swing System, Curve And Spin, Preview Trajectory and Grid-Style Landing Zone <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/560c034b4e4fd31dc2399d85d0931fc1.poster.avif?t=1717516374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/560c034b4e4fd31dc2399d85d0931fc1.webm?t=1717516374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/560c034b4e4fd31dc2399d85d0931fc1.mp4?t=1717516374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>    </li><li>Level up abilities in the Power, Technique, and Recovery skill trees! Be careful not to become a one-trick pony as different courses require a unique set of skills!<br>    </li><li>Each course features their own Pro Shop where you can purchase bizarre golf balls and clubs that have unique characteristics!<br>    </li><li>Compete in tournaments to progress in the game, where victory unlocks access to new courses, equipment, and challenges!<br>    </li><li>Many game modes to complement the main game-play loop! Mini Golf, Speed Golf, Ring Shot, Trick Shots and more!<br>    </li><li>A Variety Of Courses featuring unique themes!<br>    </li><li>Deep Character Customization! Get creative with your character's look!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Analyze, strategize, and execute impressive golf shots using classic mechanics! 3-Click Swing System, Curve And Spin, Preview Trajectory and Grid-Style Landing Zone <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/560c034b4e4fd31dc2399d85d0931fc1.poster.avif?t=1717516374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/560c034b4e4fd31dc2399d85d0931fc1.webm?t=1717516374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400710/extras/560c034b4e4fd31dc2399d85d0931fc1.mp4?t=1717516374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>    </li><li>Level up abilities in the Power, Technique, and Recovery skill trees! Be careful not to become a one-trick pony as different courses require a unique set of skills!<br>    </li><li>Each course features their own Pro Shop where you can purchase bizarre golf balls and clubs that have unique characteristics!<br>    </li><li>Compete in tournaments to progress in the game, where victory unlocks access to new courses, equipment, and challenges!<br>    </li><li>Many game modes to complement the main game-play loop! Mini Golf, Speed Golf, Ring Shot, Trick Shots and more!<br>    </li><li>A Variety Of Courses featuring unique themes!<br>    </li><li>Deep Character Customization! Get creative with your character's look!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Golf Adventure RPG with classic mechanics inspired by old school golf games. Win tournaments to unlock new courses, complete thrilling side challenges that test your wits and skill, and level up your character in the ultimate golfing adventure!",
